144812_BoardOutcome24072026.pdf","ts":"2026-07-24T14:49"},{"k":"press","t":"Press Release","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_24072026145845_PressRelease24072026.pdf","ts":"2026-07-24T14:59"},{"k":"call","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_24072026230016_InvestorsCallAudio24072026.pdf","ts":"2026-07-24T23:02"},{"k":"transcript","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","ts":"2026-07-30T11:07"}],"cm":{"items":[{"field":"improved","statement":"Laurus posted its highest ever quarterly revenue, EBITDA and profit in Q1.","quote":"Laurus maintained its strong growth momentum, delivering highest quarterly revenue, EBITDA and profits during the first quarter.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Gross margin held near 62.7% and EBITDA margin rose 7 points over the previous quarter to 31.8%.","quote":"Gross margins were also very healthy and maintained around 62.7% and EBITDA margins further expanded over previous quarter by 7 percentage points to 31.8%.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Small-molecule CDMO sales grew 69% to Rs 835 crore in Q1.","quote":"the division has continued to deliver strong operational execution in Q1, reporting a growth of 69% with the sales of INR835 crores on the small molecule side.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management is confident CDMO will be at least 50% of revenue by FY30.","quote":"At this point, we are very comfortable to say that by FY '30, we will definitely reach our target of at least 50% of revenue come from CDMO segment.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management sees good visibility and strong conviction that CDMO will deliver a lot of growth.","quote":"I may not be able to give you a number what we will grow, but we have good visibility and a lot of confidence and conviction that CDMO will definitely give a lot of growth for us.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Capex guidance of Rs 3,000 crore for FY27 and FY28 may be exceeded, but no new number was given.","quote":"Last quarter, we said INR3,000 crores for FY '27 and '28. We may do more than that, but we don't have a correct number to give you in this call.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Asset turnover will stay above 1.0x, while ROCE reaching 23% will take time because of heavy capex.","quote":"I think asset turnover ratios will be more than 1.0 for sure. And the ROCE because of heavy capex this year, maybe going to 23% will take some time.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Demand is strong for the company's complex technology platforms and integrated manufacturing.","quote":"We continue to make steady progress and a strong demand environment for multiple complex technology platforms and integrated manufacturing capabilities.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Management expects robust demand for its specialised technology offerings to continue.","quote":"As we look forward, we continue to see robust demand for our specialized technology offerings and the integrated manufacturing capabilities.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Global conflicts put some pressure on margins, but not a significant amount.","quote":"We have seen some pressure on margins because of the global conflicts, but that margin pressure is not that significant to take a shelter that because of that margins have gone down.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Gross margin was 62.7%, about 3.3 points higher, helped by division mix and process improvements.","quote":"Gross margin maintained at 62.7%, about 3.3% higher than before. This is due to the division mix and the process improvement efforts.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Management expects similar margins in the coming quarters.","quote":"So we expect the similar margins we maintain for the coming quarters as well.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"The company spent about Rs 394 crore on capex in the quarter.","quote":"On the capex front, we invested about INR394 crores for the quarter.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"This year's capacity investment is sized to customer demand.","quote":"The current year investments into capacity expansion is based on what our customer demands are and creating capacity to meet that demand.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capex","statement":"The Krka JV has absorbed Rs 400 crore so far and needs another Rs 400 crore, partly funded by a partner loan.","quote":"Currently, we have invested so far INR400 crores. And then that facility needs another INR400 crores. And part of that investment will come from loan from our partner.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"Phase 1 of the bio fermentation facility, a little over 400 kilolitres, should be operational by the end of this year.","quote":"we expect Phase 1 of this capacity, which is a little over 400 kiloliters is expected to be operational towards the end of this year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"The Krka JV oncology facility will be ready early next year and the solid oral facility in the second half of calendar 2027.","quote":"The oncology facility will be ready early next year and then solid oral facility will be second half of 2027 calendar year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"Net debt was Rs 2,656 crore with debt-to-EBITDA at 1.28x versus 1.25x last quarter.","quote":"Our net debt stood at INR2,656 crores and debt-to-EBITDA is around 1.28 against 1.25 the last quarter on the back of strong internal cash flows.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"Laurus signed a development and commercial agreement with Aarvik Therapeutics for two ADC molecules for India.","quote":"The first one is we signed a development and commercial agreement with Aarvik Therapeutics for 2 ADC molecules for India markets.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"A new office in South Africa strengthens the company's commercial presence in that region.","quote":"The establishment of a new office in South Africa further strengthens our commercial presence and positions us to capture the growing opportunities in this region.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"Management expects peptides to become a meaningful business for Laurus.","quote":"Unfortunately, we are not able to discuss any project-specific details, but we expect peptides to be a meaningful area for Laurus as a company.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAURUSLABS_30072026110532_Transcript30072026.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"The CDMO market is growing with many opportunities; the limit is the company's ability to build capacity and platforms.","quote":"the CDMO market is growing and a lot of opportunities are there. It is our ability to create capacity, create technology platforms and absorb the customer projects and all.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://